   "why": "QuartzCore CA::WindowServer::M2Display ctor: the display surface format for an ES1 (API 1) GL compositor is the literal 'L565' (16 bpp); make it 'BGRA' like API 2 so CA's GL compositor renders the 32 bpp format the CLCD scans out and the screen mirror reads (docs/gpu.md 7)"
